; Call-by-value evaluation chooses the function first, then the argument, then beta.
load lambda

(app (λ x x) unit) ⇝ unit

; The outer beta step cannot fire yet: its argument is not a value. Reduce that argument first.
value (λ x x)
(app (λ y y) unit) ⇝ unit
(app (λ x x) (app (λ y y) unit)) ⇝ (app (λ x x) unit)
(app (λ x x) unit) ⇝ unit
